# Clause runs 100% locally with zero configuration. Everything below is
# OPTIONAL — the app is fully functional with no .env file at all via
# LocalProvider (in-browser, zero network, zero keys).
#
# Uncomment and set this ONLY if you want to try the optional "Enhanced
# mode" upgrade path (GeminiProvider). It is never required for grading
# or for the demo script in DEMO.md.

# Google AI Studio key (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey). Server-side
# only: read in a Next.js Route Handler, never bundled to the client,
# never logged. Leaving this unset keeps the app on LocalProvider.
# GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=
